   "source": [
    "### Do training and prediction compute the same features?\n",
    "\n",
    "This is the most important check in the pipeline. Training reads descriptor\n",
    "columns from a file; prediction recomputes them from a SMILES. If the two\n",
    "disagree, the model silently receives wrong input on the plant compounds.\n",
    "\n",
    "Without a SMILES column this cannot be verified, and you are trusting that the\n",
    "descriptors came from plain RDKit defaults with no scaling applied afterwards."
   ]
  },
