   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Reading the results\n",
    "\n",
    "**Compare PR-AUC against the prevalence**, not against 0. Prevalence is the\n",
    "share of actives, which is what random guessing already achieves.\n",
    "\n",
    "**The probabilities are a ranking, not a verdict.** Use them to compare and\n",
    "sort compounds, not to declare one active.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Filter to `in_domain == True`** before drawing conclusions or running SHAP,\n",
    "where that column is available.\n",
    "\n",
    "## For the 5-LOX model\n",
    "\n",
    "Point the constants at the 5-LOX paths and rerun this notebook unchanged.\n",
    "\n",
    "---"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a6fb80d8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 8. Explain the model (TreeSHAP)\n",
    "\n",
    "SHAP splits each prediction into contributions of the individual features\n",
