   "source": [
    "### 9b. Top hits\n",
    "\n",
    "Only `in_domain` molecules are ranked, because predictions on molecules far\n",
    "from the training data are much less reliable. The probability is a ranking,\n",
    "not a verdict: use it to compare and prioritise, not to call a compound active."
   ]
  },
